{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You climb. Anyone else can shoot you down. Really\u2014anyone.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hijack Jump</strong> is a tricky parkour game where your success depends on friends\u2026 or enemies. Every player can be hijacked by others. Hijackers don\u2019t just watch \u2013 they can interfere with your run, blasting you with balls to knock you down, or giving you a boost to jump higher. There\u2019s no limit to how many spectators can join and mess with your game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parkour</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a towering, intricate parkour course that spans different themes and areas. Rolling pillars, firing cannons, and countless obstacles are waiting to make your life miserable. But trust us\u2014that\u2019s not all!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hijack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is where it gets wild. Think you can just focus on your own run? Wrong! Anyone can join your public session and start interfering. Whether they try to shoot you off with a giant ball or launch you upward with a jump boost, the outcome is always unpredictable. Now imagine 100 spectators out to get you\u2026 tricky, right?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2926780?t=1755838014","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926780/2885ca8b49186732f5b2586e69140058926e035e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755838014","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926780/6f85322d0f915a295b5f6d66a0e3a851a6a6b927/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755838014","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926780/6f85322d0f915a295b5f6d66a0e3a851a6a6b927/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755838014","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You climb. Anyone else can shoot you down. Really\u2014anyone.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hijack Jump</strong> is a tricky parkour game where your success depends on friends\u2026 or enemies. Every player can be hijacked by others. Hijackers don\u2019t just watch \u2013 they can interfere with your run, blasting you with balls to knock you down, or giving you a boost to jump higher. There\u2019s no limit to how many spectators can join and mess with your game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parkour</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a towering, intricate parkour course that spans different themes and areas. Rolling pillars, firing cannons, and countless obstacles are waiting to make your life miserable. But trust us\u2014that\u2019s not all!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hijack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is where it gets wild. Think you can just focus on your own run? Wrong! Anyone can join your public session and start interfering. Whether they try to shoot you off with a giant ball or launch you upward with a jump boost, the outcome is always unpredictable. Now imagine 100 spectators out to get you\u2026 tricky, right?</p>","developers":["fiftyfive development OHG"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926780/f8d26e6c316b62e6375791c257d97a837e7839e4/header.jpg?t=1755838014","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamsta